cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI-Generated Mathematical Explorations"
message: >-
  If you refer to this collection, please cite it as below. Citing an individual exploration
  attributes the mathematics to the AI system that produced it, not to the author listed here;
  see the "How to cite an exploration" section of LICENSE.md.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Santiago
    family-names: Laplagne
    affiliation: "Instituto de Cálculo, Universidad de Buenos Aires"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: >-
  A curated archive of mathematical claims, arguments and possible proofs generated by AI
  systems in the context of research activities of Santiago Laplagne at the Instituto de
  Cálculo, Universidad de Buenos Aires, much of it joint work with colleagues. The author
  listed here selected the problems, provided the research context and made the material
  public; the mathematical content was produced by the AI systems and is published unverified.
  No authorship of these mathematical results is claimed, and they have not all been
  independently verified. Each exploration records its provenance and its current
  verification status.
repository-code: "https://github.com/slap/ai-mathematical-explorations"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - CC0-1.0
keywords:
  - mathematics
  - artificial intelligence
  - AI-generated proofs
  - unverified results
  - open peer review
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
